---

- info: 'main_hero'
  type: 'section_callout_parallax'
  meta:
    replace: false
  fields:
    field_image_hero: 'https://buda.mavericksdancehall.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2022/02/randall-king-wallpaper.jpg'
    field_class_name: 'a2026_main_hero'
    field_custom_css: |
      .a2026_main_hero { height: 100vh; }


- id: 'contact_us_simple'
  type: 'webform'
  title: 'Contact Us'
  elements:
    name: {}
    email: {}
    message:
      type: 'textarea'



- info: 'main_4icon_1'
  meta:
    replace: false
  type: 'advanced_block'
  fields:
    field_class_name: a2026_main_4icon_each
    field_subtitle: FIVE BARS
    field_image_thumb: https://buda.mavericksdancehall.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2019/05/saloon.png
    body:
      format: full_html
      value: |
        <span>We have a bar on our patio and four bars positioned around the large dance floor.</span>
- info: 'main_4icon_2'
  meta:
    replace: false
  type: 'advanced_block'
  fields:
    field_class_name: a2026_main_4icon_each
    field_subtitle: LIVE MUSIC
    field_image_thumb: https://buda.mavericksdancehall.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2019/05/live_music.png
    body:
      format: full_html
      value: |
        <span>We have live music and DJs to provide great entertainment all night long. Check our calendar.</span>
- info: 'main_4icon_3'
  type: 'advanced_block'
  meta:
    replace: false
  fields:
    field_class_name: a2026_main_4icon_each
    field_subtitle: LARGE DANCE FLOOR
    field_image_thumb: https://buda.mavericksdancehall.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2019/05/dancing.png
    body:
      format: full_html
      value: |
        <span>Our large dance floor is the center of entertainment and community here at Mavericks.</span>
- info: 'main_4icon_4'
  meta:
    replace: false
  type: 'advanced_block'
  fields:
    field_class_name: a2026_main_4icon_each
    field_subtitle: HUGE PATIO
    field_image_thumb: https://buda.mavericksdancehall.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2019/05/games.png
    body:
      format: full_html
      value: |
        <span>Our patio provides a relaxing and fun atmosphere with games and live DJs Thur-Sat.</span>

